# Implementation Plan - Module 5 Dashboard Module

Implement a high-fidelity, role-specific personal and team dashboard matching the Stitch design (Screen ID `5fcbccf509eb4ddfa625c91f3ffeecd8`). This dashboard will display spend summaries, active policy flags, and recent claims in real-time, enforcing security isolation and manager-level direct report aggregations.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Role-Based Views**:
>   - **Employee**: Welcomes the user by name, displays personal metrics (Pending Reimbursement amount, Approved This Month, Active Policy Flags), AI Insights, and a list of their recent personal submissions.
>   - **Manager / Admin / Finance**: Displays team/organizational metrics (Pending Approvals count, Team Approved Spend, Total Policy Violations) and a list of recent submissions across their direct reports or the entire company, including employee names.
> - **Manager Direct Report Aggregations**: The manager dashboard will dynamically resolve the manager's direct reports and aggregate only their expenses, satisfying KPI `DASH-03`.
> - **Security Isolation**: Enforces role checks on the controller level, preventing normal employees from querying manager/organization-wide dashboard statistics (KPI `DASH-06`).

